Package: shex
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: encrypted Redis-routed remote shell
 shex authenticates a shared code with OPAQUE and encrypts commands and
 results end to end with ChaCha20-Poly1305. Redis routes ciphertext without
 receiving plaintext credentials, commands, command output, or shell state.
